  $}

  ${
    syl6d.1 $e |- ( ph -> ( ps -> ( ch -> th ) ) ) $.
    syl6d.2 $e |- ( ph -> ( th -> ta ) ) $.
    $( A nested syllogism deduction.  Deduction associated with ~ syl6 .
