  ${
    pm2.61iii.1 $e |- ( -. ph -> ( -. ps -> ( -. ch -> th ) ) ) $.
    pm2.61iii.2 $e |- ( ph -> th ) $.
    pm2.61iii.3 $e |- ( ps -> th ) $.
    pm2.61iii.4 $e |- ( ch -> th ) $.
    $( Inference eliminating three antecedents.  (Contributed by NM,
