  ${
    mpbidi.min $e |- ( th -> ( ph -> ps ) ) $.
    mpbidi.maj $e |- ( ph -> ( ps <-> ch ) ) $.
    $( A deduction from a biconditional, related to modus ponens.  (Contributed
