  pm2.25 $p |- ( ph \/ ( ( ph \/ ps ) -> ps ) ) $=
    ( wo wi orel1 orri ) AABCBDABEF $.

  $( A wff is equivalent to its disjunction with falsehood.  Theorem *4.74 of
