     shortened by Wolf Lammen, 18-Nov-2012.) $)
  biorf $p |- ( -. ph -> ( ps <-> ( ph \/ ps ) ) ) $=
    ( wn wo olc orel1 impbid2 ) ACBABDBAEABFG $.

