  biortn $p |- ( ph -> ( ps <-> ( -. ph \/ ps ) ) ) $=
    ( wn wo wb notnot biorf syl ) AACZCBIBDEAFIBGH $.

  ${
    biorfi.1 $e |- -. ph $.
    $( A wff is equivalent to its disjunction with falsehood.  (Contributed by
