  pm2.62 $p |- ( ( ph \/ ps ) -> ( ( ph -> ps ) -> ps ) ) $=
    ( wi wo pm2.621 com12 ) ABCABDBABEF $.

  $( Theorem *2.68 of [WhiteheadRussell] p. 108.  (Contributed by NM,
