  pm2.68 $p |- ( ( ( ph -> ps ) -> ps ) -> ( ph \/ ps ) ) $=
    ( wi jarl orrd ) ABCBCABABBDE $.

  $( Logical 'or' expressed in terms of implication only.  Theorem *5.25 of
