  dfor2 $p |- ( ( ph \/ ps ) <-> ( ( ph -> ps ) -> ps ) ) $=
    ( wo wi pm2.62 pm2.68 impbii ) ABCABDBDABEABFG $.

  $( Implication in terms of disjunction.  Theorem *4.6 of [WhiteheadRussell]
