  imor $p |- ( ( ph -> ps ) <-> ( -. ph \/ ps ) ) $=
    ( wi wn wo notnotb imbi1i df-or bitr4i ) ABCADZDZBCJBEAKBAFGJBHI $.

  ${
    imori.1 $e |- ( ph -> ps ) $.
    $( Infer disjunction from implication.  (Contributed by NM,
