    imori $p |- ( -. ph \/ ps ) $=
      ( wi wn wo imor mpbi ) ABDAEBFCABGH $.
  $}

  ${
    imorri.1 $e |- ( -. ph \/ ps ) $.
    $( Infer implication from disjunction.  (Contributed by Jonathan Ben-Naim,
