  pm3.21 $p |- ( ph -> ( ps -> ( ps /\ ph ) ) ) $=
    ( wa pm3.2 com12 ) BABACBADE $.

  $( Theorem *3.22 of [WhiteheadRussell] p. 111.  (Contributed by NM,
