  $( Commutative law for conjunction.  Theorem *4.3 of [WhiteheadRussell]
     p. 118.  (Contributed by NM, 25-Jun-1998.)  (Proof shortened by Wolf
     Lammen, 4-Nov-2012.) $)
  ancom $p |- ( ( ph /\ ps ) <-> ( ps /\ ph ) ) $=
