       ~ https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Syllogism .  (Contributed by David A.
       Wheeler, 27-Aug-2016.)  (Revised by David A. Wheeler, 2-Sep-2016.) $)
    celaront $p |- E. x ( ch /\ -. ps ) $=
      ( wn barbari ) ABHCDEFGI $.
  $}

