  $( Equality theorem for negated membership.  (Contributed by NM,
     20-Nov-1994.)  (Proof shortened by Wolf Lammen, 25-Nov-2019.) $)
  neleq1 $p |- ( A = B -> ( A e/ C <-> B e/ C ) ) $=
