  ${
    $d y A $.  $d z B $.
    nfneld.1 $e |- ( ph -> F/_ x A ) $.
    nfneld.2 $e |- ( ph -> F/_ x B ) $.
    $( Bound-variable hypothesis builder for negated membership.  (Contributed
