  elnelne1 $p |- ( ( A e. B /\ A e/ C ) -> B =/= C ) $=
    ( wnel wcel wn wne df-nel nelne1 sylan2b ) ACDABEACEFBCGACHABCIJ $.

  $( Two classes are different if they don't belong to the same class.
