    sseqtri $p |- A C_ C $=
      ( wss sseq2i mpbi ) ABFACFDBCAEGH $.
  $}

  ${
    sseqtr4.1 $e |- A C_ B $.
    sseqtr4.2 $e |- C = B $.
    $( Substitution of equality into a subclass relationship.  (Contributed by
