      cvv 0ex syl6eqel pm2.61i ) BPCZTABDZPCTABPETFZUAGPUBTABHZFUAGIUBTABUBAJBC
      KLUCUAGTABMNOQRS $.

    $( Equality theorem based on ~ class2set .  (Contributed by NM,
       13-Dec-2005.)  (Proof shortened by Raph Levien, 30-Jun-2006.) $)
