     (inverted iota). $)
  cio $a class ( iota x ph ) $.

  ${
    $d w x z $.  $d ph w z $.  $d ph w y $.  $d x y $.
    $( Soundness justification theorem for ~ df-iota .  (Contributed by Andrew
       Salmon, 29-Jun-2011.) $)
    iotajust $p |- U. { y | { x | ph } = { y } } =
