    EMOBDGMPADABHIJABDKL $.

  ${
    $d x y z R $.  $d x A $.  $d x y z ph $.
    iserd.1 $e |- ( ph -> Rel R ) $.
    iserd.2 $e |- ( ( ph /\ x R y ) -> y R x ) $.
    iserd.3 $e |- ( ( ph /\ ( x R y /\ y R z ) ) -> x R z ) $.
    iserd.4 $e |- ( ph -> ( x e. A <-> x R x ) ) $.
    $( A reflexive, symmetric, transitive relation is an equivalence relation
