    iseri.3 $e |- ( ( x R y /\ y R z ) -> x R z ) $.
    iseri.4 $e |- ( x e. A <-> x R x ) $.
    $( A reflexive, symmetric, transitive relation is an equivalence relation
       on its domain.  Inference version of ~ iserd , which avoids the need to
