    ( cvv wcel wn csuc sucprc wa elirr csn wss cun df-suc eqeq1i ssequn2 bitr4i
    wceq biimpi snidg ssel2 syl2an mto imnani impbii ) ABCZDAEZAPZAFUFUDUFUDGAA
