      USWPWKWNHXCWPWMHLXBWNHRWLBHVFXDWMVGVHVIVOVJKCNWNVKWQCBQCDNWNVLVMCDWBHVNVP
      WBHKVQS $.

    $( The cardinal number of a set is an ordinal number.  Proposition 10.6(1)
       of [TakeutiZaring] p. 85.  (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 7-Jan-2013.)
       (Revised by Mario Carneiro, 13-Sep-2013.) $)
