      ( vy vx cv cen wbr con0 wrex cab ccrd cardf2 0elon f0cli ) BDCDEFBGHCIGAJ
      CBKLM $.

    $( A way to express well-orderability without bound or distinct variables.
       (Contributed by Stefan O'Rear, 28-Feb-2015.)  (Revised by Mario
